<title>GERMANY: Ruetgers turns to profit in nine-months.</title>
<headline>Ruetgers turns to profit in nine-months.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>First nine months of year</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Parent pre-tax profit		    47	vs 97 loss</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		     97.4    vs n/a</p>
<p>    Group sales				  3,084   down four pct</p>
<p>NOTE - German chemicals group Ruetgers AG said it was expecting a group pre-tax profit in the region of 150 million marks, including a one-off gain of 40 million marks. The parent company expects to post earnings of 70 million marks.</p>
<p>Ruetgers said in a statement it expected further &quot;satisfactory development in profits&quot;.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
